{"seq":2,"slug":"warehousing-packaging-carbon","title":"仓储与包装环节碳排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-logistics-carbon-footprint/fulfillment-emission-calc/warehousing-packaging-carbon","wordCount":1988,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"仓储与包装环节碳排\">仓储与包装环节碳排</h1><p>仓储和包装在跨境碳足迹里通常占比不高，但它们是两个&quot;容易被审计抓住&quot;的环节：仓储因为有明确的面积与时长可以计量，包装因为材料清单必须逐项列明。算错这两个环节，问题往往不在算术，而在<strong>边界与计量口径的模糊</strong>——仓库的公共区域能耗算不算？循环使用的周转箱算几次？</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>仓储排放的本质是&quot;占用时间与空间的间接能耗分摊&quot;，包装排放的本质是&quot;材料质量乘以材料隐含碳因子&quot;。两者的共同点是都必须先建立一个可计量的活动量单位。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>仓储排放</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mtext>facility</mtext></munder><mfrac><mtext>设施总能耗排放</mtext><mtext>设施总占用</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mtext>订单占用</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{仓储排放} = \\sum_{\\text{facility}} \\frac{\\text{设施总能耗排放}}{\\text{设施总占用}} \\times \\text{订单占用}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">仓储排放</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7986em;vertical-align:-1.4382em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">facility</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">设施总占用</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">设施总能耗排放</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">订单占用</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>包装排放</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mtext>material</mtext></munder><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>material</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>E</mi><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>material</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>处置段</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{包装排放} = \\sum_{\\text{material}} W_{\\text{material}} \\times EF_{\\text{material}} + \\text{处置段}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">包装排放</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3521em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">material</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">material</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">material</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">处置段</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[仓储与包装] --&gt; B[仓储设施]&#10;  A --&gt; C[包装材料]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[照明与空调]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[装卸与搬运设备]&#10;  B --&gt; B3[冷库制冷]&#10;  B --&gt; B4[IT 与安防]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[纸质: 瓦楞箱/填充]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[塑料: 缠绕膜/气泡膜]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[金属: 托盘/卡扣]&#10;  C --&gt; C4[木质: 托盘/垫木]&#10;  B1 --&gt; D[电力因子区域化]&#10;  B2 --&gt; E[燃料或电力]&#10;  B3 --&gt; F[制冷剂逸散]&#10;  C1 --&gt; G[材料隐含碳因子]&#10;  C2 --&gt; G&#10;  C3 --&gt; G&#10;  C4 --&gt; G\">graph TD\n  A[仓储与包装] --&gt; B[仓储设施]\n  A --&gt; C[包装材料]\n  B --&gt; B1[照明与空调]\n  B --&gt; B2[装卸与搬运设备]\n  B --&gt; B3[冷库制冷]\n  B --&gt; B4[IT 与安防]\n  C --&gt; C1[纸质: 瓦楞箱/填充]\n  C --&gt; C2[塑料: 缠绕膜/气泡膜]\n  C --&gt; C3[金属: 托盘/卡扣]\n  C --&gt; C4[木质: 托盘/垫木]\n  B1 --&gt; D[电力因子区域化]\n  B2 --&gt; E[燃料或电力]\n  B3 --&gt; F[制冷剂逸散]\n  C1 --&gt; G[材料隐含碳因子]\n  C2 --&gt; G\n  C3 --&gt; G\n  C4 --&gt; G</pre><p>注意 B3 单独列出的原因：<strong>冷库的制冷剂逸散是仓储排放里唯一一种非 CO₂ 的强温室气体来源</strong>。制冷剂通常是 HFC 类，GWP 成千上万。用体积法估算冷库排放时如果把制冷剂漏掉，在只有少量冷库体积的情况下可能导致整体低估。这部分必须用&quot;年补充量&quot;作为活动数据来估算逸散，而不能用能耗反推。</p>\n<h2 id=\"仓库能耗的获取路径\">仓库能耗的获取路径</h2><h3 id=\"公用事业账单-面积强度-订单均摊\">公用事业账单、面积强度、订单均摊</h3><p>按数据质量从高到低，仓库能耗的获取有三条路径：</p>\n<p><strong>路径一：公用事业账单</strong>。直接读取每个设施的月度电费单与燃气账单，得到 kWh 与立方米，再乘区域化电力因子与燃料因子。这是最高质量的数据，也是审计最容易接受的。前提是仓库由自己运营或能拿到分表数据。</p>\n<p><strong>路径二：面积强度估算</strong>。当拿不到账单（例如第三方仓、共享仓）时，用&quot;每平方米每年的能耗强度 × 占用面积 × 存储天数比例&quot;。这里的强度值必须绑定仓库类型：常温平库、立体高架库、冷藏库的强度差异极大，冷库可以是常温库的十几倍。</p>\n<p><strong>路径三：按订单均摊</strong>。最粗糙的做法是拿第三方仓的仓储费反推。极不推荐用于对外披露，只能用于内部热点筛查——仓储费里包含人工、租金、管理费，与能耗没有稳定比例关系。</p>\n<p>占用量的分摊基础也需要选定。可选的有三种，工程上按可得性排序：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分摊基础</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>数据可得性</th>\n<th>偏差来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>体积天数</td>\n<td>订单体积 × 存储天数</td>\n<td>高（WMS 有）</td>\n<td>对轻抛货有利，对重货不利</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>托盘天数</td>\n<td>占用托盘位 × 天数</td>\n<td>高（若按托盘管理）</td>\n<td>混装托盘难拆分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量天数</td>\n<td>订单质量 × 存储天数</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>忽略了体积占位成本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>推荐用<strong>体积天数</strong>作为默认基础，因为它最贴近仓库空间的真实占用（仓储成本主要由容积驱动），且 WMS 里通常直接可得。但当仓库以重货为主且货架按承重设计时，质量天数更合理。</p>\n<p>跨境场景还有一个特殊项：<strong>保税仓与海外仓的存储时长差异巨大</strong>。同一个 SKU 在保税仓可能只停留几天（快速清关转运），在海外仓可能停留两三个月（备货）。用同一条强度值会导致海外仓的仓储排放大得不成比例——这不是错误，而是事实：长期备货确实占用了更多空间与能耗。核算要做的是如实反映这种差异，而不是把它抹平。</p>\n<h2 id=\"包装材料的因子与减重\">包装材料的因子与减重</h2><h3 id=\"可见包装与不可见包装\">可见包装与不可见包装</h3><p>包装排放的算式简单，难点在材料清单的完整性。跨境包装通常包含看得见的与看不见的两层：</p>\n<p><strong>可见包装</strong>（计入消费者感知）：外箱、内衬、填充物、封箱胶带、标签。\n<strong>不可见包装</strong>（只在供应链内流转）：托盘、缠绕膜、栈板、垫木、周转箱。</p>\n<p>不可见包装是否计入，取决于系统边界口径（见 <a href=\"../../pcf-method-boundary/pcf-iso14067-ghg-boundary\">ISO 14067 与 GHG Protocol 的边界划定</a>）。如果声明单位是&quot;1 件商品到买家手上&quot;，托盘与缠绕膜属于运输环节的辅助物，通常按运输批次摊到商品上；如果声明单位是&quot;1 件商品出厂&quot;，它们可能不在边界内。<strong>规则是把分摊逻辑写进声明，而不是想当然地忽略</strong>。</p>\n<p>材料因子的取值纪律是<strong>分材质、不取混合平均</strong>。下面是一张相对量级表，用于检查计算结果是否离谱（绝对值必须以实际因子库为准）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>材料</th>\n<th>隐含碳量级（相对）</th>\n<th>主要来源</th>\n<th>减重潜力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原生纸/瓦楞</td>\n<td>1（基准）</td>\n<td>制浆与造纸能耗</td>\n<td>高（减薄、缩小箱型）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>再生纸/瓦楞</td>\n<td>0.4–0.6</td>\n<td>回收浆</td>\n<td>高（同等强度下更轻）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚乙烯薄膜</td>\n<td>3–5</td>\n<td>石化路线</td>\n<td>中（减薄、改可回收）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚苯乙烯泡沫</td>\n<td>6–9</td>\n<td>石化路线、发泡能耗</td>\n<td>高（改纸质内衬）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铝</td>\n<td>20–60</td>\n<td>电解铝高耗电</td>\n<td>低（但可用再生铝降至 1/5–1/10）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>钢</td>\n<td>15–40</td>\n<td>高炉路线</td>\n<td>低（再生钢可显著降低）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>木材（托盘）</td>\n<td>0.6–1.2</td>\n<td>干燥与加工</td>\n<td>中（周转替代一次性）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>铝与钢的行有一个重要含义：<strong>同一材料的原生与再生路线因子差异可达五到十倍</strong>。所以当供应商只给&quot;铝制配件 0.8 kg&quot;而没说原料来源时，你只能取原生因子，结果必然高估。这类高估在碳标签场景下对卖家不利（数字难看），在 CBAM 场景下对企业有利（数字低申报风险）。两个方向都不能靠猜。</p>\n<p>包装还有一个特殊的口径问题：<strong>循环使用包装的分摊次数</strong>。一个可循环周转箱如果设计寿命是 50 次，它的隐含碳应当除以 50 再摊到每次使用上，而不是每次都全额计入。这一条在欧盟包装与包装废弃物法规（PPWR, Regulation (EU) 2025/40）的框架下会越来越重要——该法规 2025 年 2 月 11 日生效、2026 年 8 月 12 日开始适用，目标是 2030 年前让所有包装以经济可行的方式可回收，并要求减少包装体积与原生材料使用（<a href=\"https://environment.ec.europa.eu/topics/waste-and-recycling/packaging-waste_en\">欧盟委员会包装与包装废弃物</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实现-包装材料清单的结构\">实现：包装材料清单的结构</h2><p>包装环节的工程化核心是一张随 SKU 绑定的物料清单（BOM），每个 SKU 对应一组包装物料及其用量。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;sku&quot;: &quot;HOME-ORG-4PK&quot;,&#10;  &quot;declared_unit&quot;: &quot;1 件&quot;,&#10;  &quot;packaging_bom&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;material&quot;: &quot;corrugated_board&quot;,&#10;      &quot;spec&quot;: &quot;BC 五层&quot;,&#10;      &quot;kg_per_unit&quot;: 0.38,&#10;      &quot;recycled_share&quot;: 0.7,&#10;      &quot;factor_ref&quot;: &quot;EF-DB-2026/corrugated&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;material&quot;: &quot;ldpe_film&quot;,&#10;      &quot;spec&quot;: &quot;50um 缠绕&quot;,&#10;      &quot;kg_per_unit&quot;: 0.021,&#10;      &quot;recycled_share&quot;: 0.0,&#10;      &quot;factor_ref&quot;: &quot;EF-DB-2026/ldpe&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;material&quot;: &quot;paper_filler&quot;,&#10;      &quot;spec&quot;: &quot;牛皮纸填充&quot;,&#10;      &quot;kg_per_unit&quot;: 0.09,&#10;      &quot;recycled_share&quot;: 0.85,&#10;      &quot;factor_ref&quot;: &quot;EF-DB-2026/kraft&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;reusable_transit&quot;: [{ &quot;item&quot;: &quot;plastic_crate&quot;, &quot;embed_kg_co2e&quot;: 6.4, &quot;design_cycles&quot;: 50, &quot;alloc_rule&quot;: &quot;per_use&quot; }],&#10;  &quot;storage&quot;: { &quot;warehouse_type&quot;: &quot;ambient_racking&quot;, &quot;volume_m3&quot;: 0.018, &quot;avg_days_in_fc&quot;: 42, &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;volume_days&quot; }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"HOME-ORG-4PK\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"declared_unit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1 件\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"packaging_bom\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"material\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"corrugated_board\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"spec\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"BC 五层\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"kg_per_unit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.38</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"recycled_share\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"factor_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EF-DB-2026/corrugated\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"material\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ldpe_film\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"spec\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"50um 缠绕\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"kg_per_unit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.021</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"recycled_share\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"factor_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EF-DB-2026/ldpe\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"material\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"paper_filler\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"spec\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"牛皮纸填充\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"kg_per_unit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.09</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"recycled_share\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.85</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"factor_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EF-DB-2026/kraft\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reusable_transit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"item\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"plastic_crate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"embed_kg_co2e\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"design_cycles\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"alloc_rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"per_use\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"storage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"warehouse_type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ambient_racking\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"volume_m3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.018</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"avg_days_in_fc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"volume_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>recycled_share</code> 是必填字段的原因在于：它直接决定了该材质取原生还是再生因子，两者可以差五倍以上。把它做成 SKU 级属性，等于把&quot;减碳&quot;这件事从报告语言变成了主数据字段——采购改一次供应商，碳足迹自动变化，不需要人工重算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>仓储排放是时间与空间的间接能耗分摊；体积天数是最贴近仓储成本驱动的默认分摊基础。</li>\n<li>冷库制冷剂逸散必须用年补充量单独估算，不能靠能耗反推，否则漏掉高 GWP 气体。</li>\n<li>包装材料因子必须分材质取，禁止混合平均；原生与再生路线的因子差异可达五到十倍。</li>\n<li>循环包装按设计循环次数分摊隐含碳，不能每次全额计入。</li>\n<li>把 <code>recycled_share</code> 做成 SKU 主数据字段，让采购决策直接驱动碳足迹变化。</li>\n<li>下一段：把最后一公里按单摊开的模型，见 <a href=\"../../fulfillment-emission-calc/lastmile-fulfillment-carbon\">尾程配送碳排与合并派送</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"仓储与包装环节碳排","id":"仓储与包装环节碳排"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"仓库能耗的获取路径","id":"仓库能耗的获取路径"},{"level":3,"text":"公用事业账单、面积强度、订单均摊","id":"公用事业账单-面积强度-订单均摊"},{"level":2,"text":"包装材料的因子与减重","id":"包装材料的因子与减重"},{"level":3,"text":"可见包装与不可见包装","id":"可见包装与不可见包装"},{"level":2,"text":"实现：包装材料清单的结构","id":"实现-包装材料清单的结构"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"运输方式与里程碳排放模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-logistics-carbon-footprint/fulfillment-emission-calc/transport-mode-distance-model"},"next":{"title":"尾程配送碳排与合并派送","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-logistics-carbon-footprint/fulfillment-emission-calc/lastmile-fulfillment-carbon"}}